        "fileName": "gravity.exterior_studio.2.4.0.2.1.1.0.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T17:54:12.824Z",
        "changeLog": "Faster Exterior entry, category switching and large catalogs with deferred details and bounded caches; tank switching with tier/class/nation filters; all-season applied-items overview beside checkout; combined Base64 outfit import/export with read-only export and no custom assets; Apply to all seasons; larger card artwork, owned counts and editing gear icons; smooth swipe momentum; richer delayed tooltips with large animated art, cursor offset, hover updates during scrolling and dismissal outside the game; animated camouflage/decal cards with source timing and no 24-frame cap; native 2D style details; clearer attachment collection labels and nearby editing controls; hide unavailable actions and restore the catalog after style adjustment; keep filter menus within bounds; Suitable only toggle; clearer checkout reasons and compatibility checks for purchasable items and Camo Selector previews."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.1.1",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.4.0.2",
        "fileName": "gravity.exterior_studio.2.4.0.2.1.1.1.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T11:26:06.498Z",
        "changeLog": "Added Traditional Chinese translation; improved tooltip dismissal when leaving hovered items."
      }
